<title>USA: Wal-Mart Stores Inc March sales rise.</title>
<headline>Wal-Mart Stores Inc March sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>BENTONVILLE, Ark. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	    $10,287     $9,060     +13.5	 +7.2</p>
<p>Year-to-date   $17,979    $15,879     +13.2	 +7.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   five weeks ended	 April 4.</p>
<p>March same-store sales for Wal-Mart division rose 8.5 pct.</p>
<p>March same-store sales for Sam's Club division rose 2.6 pct.</p>
</text>
